OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FSome sunshine at first,
OL,6,Fotherwise mainly cloudy with showers
OL,7,For longer spells of rain and some
OL,8,Fbrief sunny intervals. Gale force
OL,9,Fsoutherly winds increasing severe gale
OL,10,Fforce and veering southwesterly.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FClear intervals and blustery
OL,13,Fshowers, accompanied by gale force
OL,14,Fsouthwesterly winds, these gradually
OL,15,Feasing strong overnight with the
OL,16,Fshowers becoming less frequent.
OL,17,
OL,18,CWednesday:FA mixture of bright or
OL,19,Fsunny intervals and occasional
OL,20,Fshowers. Fresh to strong southwesterly
OL,21,Fwinds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
