OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FDry
OL,6,Fwith some sunshine on Thursday.
OL,7,FCloudier with some rain likely on
OL,8,FFriday, then bright and mainly dry on
OL,9,FSaturday.
